{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21623","headline":"贻蜀五首 李中丞表臣 · 元稹","name":"贻蜀五首 李中丞表臣","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"韦门同是旧亲宾，独恨潘牀簟有尘。\n十里花谿锦城丽，五年沙尾白头新。\n倅戎何事劳专席，老掾甘心逐衆人。\n却待文星上天去，少分光影照沈沦。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21623.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21623","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}